# ED9M-0060 (six cars: G M P M MR GR) driven from its rear cab after a
# change of ends, as testers did it (2026-11-18): high voltage and the
# breaker came up in the new cab, the motor cars took notch 1 and gave no
# force. ed9m.dll's Run hands the controller to the motor cars only with
# the cab's ЭПК key (26) on and its КЛУБ powered (58, 59), besides the
# ППТ at «Головной» and the pipe above 4 (decompiled, 2026-11-18). Init
# sets them in the cab the train starts in; the other cab is cold.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_ED9M-0060 mdd_ED9M-0060_G mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_P mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_MR mdd_ED9M-0060_GR --script tests/data/ed9m_change_ends.script
1    voltage 25000 50
# The front cab: key to neutral and out, ППТ «Хвостовой».
2    switch 1 2
2.5  switch 1 0
3    switch 28 2
# The rear cab: ППТ «Головной», key in; cold: ЭПК key and КЛУБ off.
4    enter 5
4.5  switch 28 0
5    switch 1 2
5.5  expect master == 1
5.5  expect sw26 == 0
5.5  expect sw58 == 0
# Without them the controller moves and nothing pulls.
6    switch 1 3
7    switch 0 6
9    switch 0 7
20   expect speed < 0.1
20   expect main_switch == 1
21   switch 0 5
# The ЭПК key on and the КЛУБ powered: it pulls.
22   switch 26 1
22.5 switch 58 1
23   switch 59 1
24   switch 0 6
26   switch 0 7
34   expect speed > 1
